WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.509
Ever tried to sit still, only to have

00:00:01.509 --> 00:00:03.297
your mind wander seconds later?

00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:05.825
Imagine your attention as an elephant

00:00:05.825 --> 00:00:08.727
in a busy market. Give its trunk a bamboo

00:00:08.727 --> 00:00:09.818
stick to hold.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.868
First, count your pay. Notice how attention

00:00:12.868 --> 00:00:14.680
settles when the task feels valuable.

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:17.109
Then make a ten-minute contract. Put

00:00:17.109 --> 00:00:18.793
the email, deadlines, and worries on

00:00:18.793 --> 00:00:20.302
a shelf. They can wait.

00:00:20.967 --> 00:00:22.755
Walk through seven temple gates, from

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:25.007
the noisy bazaar toward the quiet within.

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:27.606
Let the training wheels fall away. Less

00:00:27.606 --> 00:00:29.684
correction. More continuity. A moment

00:00:29.684 --> 00:00:30.590
of stillness.

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:33.635
The Srirangam Corridor. From The Self-Driving

00:00:33.635 --> 00:00:35.725
Mind. Take the four-minute walk.